  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Release Notes\n\n## 2.9.5\n\n### Added\n\n- add mapping of `ThinkingLevel` (e7adca0)\n- add handling of `Dimensions` (2505516)\n- add fluent methods (7e7e0f1)\n- add helper method to use `FileSearch` (0adaa26)\n- add sample using Microsoft Agent Framework (04fcbef)\n- add `ILogger` parameter (88b00f2)\n- add tests for GetResponseAsync (3425cb0)\n- add .NET version specifics (eab893e)\n- Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' (018a484)\n- Merge pull request #153 from PederHP/FixComputerUseEnvironment (d054d02)\n\n### Changed\n\n- remove model `learnlm-2.0-flash-experimental`\n- remove model `learnlm-1.5-pro-experimental` (83abac8)\n- remove model `gemini-2.5-pro-preview-03-25`\n- remove model `gemini-2.5-pro-preview-05-06`\n- remove model `gemini-2.5-pro-preview-06-05`\n- remove model `gemini-2.0-flash-thinking-exp-01-21`\n- remove model `gemini-2.0-flash-thinking-exp`\n- remove model `gemini-2.0-flash-thinking-exp-1219`\n- remove model `gemini-2.0-flash-thinking-exp-no-thoughts` (b76a2c0)\n- provide discontinuation date (d26a4e6)\n- remove API key for Google Maps tool (f89e0a9)\n- extend sample MEAI project (a514c9f)\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fix bugs (734828f)\n- Fix JsonConverter type for ComputerUseEnvironment enum (247ed9a)\n\n## Changelog\n\nChanges across all versions have been documented in the [Changelog](CHANGELOG.md).",
